cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use MaxEntLab in your research or teaching, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "MaxEntLab: A Maximum Entropy constraint-based modeling tool"
abstract: >-
  MaxEntLab fits constraint weights in Maximum Entropy grammars to tableau
  data. It handles categorical and variable data, supports hidden structure by
  marginalizing over the parses of each overt output, and offers L1 or L2
  regularization. It runs in the browser or as a Python library.
authors:
